  "description": "The charts of a DeepSharp run, drawn from what the training loop and the measures already keep, never from arrays anybody assembles: the loss curve of the training and the validation rows, the learning rate every epoch took, a confusion matrix as a heatmap of counts, what a model predicted against what was there, what was left over, every measure as bars beside the training rows' average, and a correlation as a heatmap. Each chart is handed out as the text of an SVG, drawn by MatPlotLibNet, and kept in a package of its own so a trainer on a machine with no screen never carries a renderer.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
